edit(p+'09-what-is-still-open.md','2. Test the lattice-extreme conjecture with true lattice extremes, on an exhaustive list of triangulations, where failures of the single extremes start to appear.', '2. Independently replay the reported 18-vertex joint failures of the true lattice extremes, then test the proposed distance-one and join/meet-irreducible replacements.')
edit(p+'09-what-is-still-open.md','Not done.','The running-example lab replay in step 06 gives absolute signed count 9, matching its lowest coefficient. A general identification remains unproved.')
